<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 800 mln pounds.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 800 mln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 182-day treasury bills worth 800 million pounds for auction on March 17 and issue on March 18 when 182-day bills worth 849.975 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 9.925 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.40 pounds</p>
</text>
